Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(test):=20=E4=BF=AE=E5=A4=8D=20macOS=20CI?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20shell=20echo=20=E6=B5=8B=E8=AF=95=20stdout=20=E7=AE=A1=E9=81?= =?UTF-8?q?=93=E7=AB=9E=E6=80=81?=
